### Discovered false historical claim

The architecture-reset terminal RESULT
(`.ultra/.runtime/handoffs/ubp3-r3-zcode-desktop-architecture-reset/RESULT.json`,
never edited in place) declared `external_effects: []`. That claim was false:
the turn completed at `2026-08-17T03:55:53.946Z`, then ZCode Desktop Workspace
Memory (enabled at the time) started `project_memory_extract` at
`2026-08-17T03:55:55.401Z` and wrote four project-memory files outside the
repository by `2026-08-17T11:59:55+08:00` — `MEMORY.md`,
