`receipt-digest-honesty.md` under
`/Users/rocky243/.zcode/cli/memories/projects/ultra-builder-pro-cli-05e84df456acc50e/memory`.
Extraction is a Host post-turn lifecycle effect that runs after terminal model
text, so the receiver could not observe it inside its own pass; the dishonesty
was claiming zero future effect, not missing a file.

